sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Warga (browser)
  participant B as Backend
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant M as Email
  Note over W,M: A. Login pertama (akun dibuat admin)
  W->>B: POST /auth/login (email + password sementara)
  B->>D: SELECT user WHERE email=$1
  B->>B: Argon2id verify (waktu disamakan)
  B-->>W: 200 {next: otp} (BELUM ada sesi)
  B->>D: fn_otp_issue(user, activation, HMAC(kode))
  B->>M: kirim kode 6 digit (tanpa password)
  W->>B: POST /auth/activate/verify-otp (email, kode)
  B->>D: fn_otp_verify(...) -> ok + tiket 10 menit
  B-->>W: tiket (sekali pakai)
  W->>B: POST /auth/set-password (tiket, password baru >=12)
  B->>D: fn_set_password(hash tiket, Argon2id baru)
  Note right of D: akun aktif, sesi lama dicabut, audit
  W->>B: POST /auth/login (password baru)
  B->>D: INSERT sessions (SHA-256 token)
  B-->>W: Set-Cookie HttpOnly Secure SameSite
  Note over W,M: B. Lupa password
  W->>B: POST /auth/forgot (email)
  B-->>W: respons generik (sama untuk email apa pun)
  B->>D: fn_otp_issue(user, password_reset, ...)
  B->>M: kode 6 digit (hanya jika akun aktif)
  W->>B: verify-otp -> tiket -> set-password
